        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the haunting world of Ardena, a first-person survival horror game that will test your wits and courage. Alone in a shadowy forest surrounded by an eerie silence, your only solace is a flickering campfire. But the fire won’t last forever—it’s up to you to keep it alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood to fuel your campfire, your only shield against the encroaching darkness. The fire's glow keeps you safe, but as it fades, the forest becomes more menacing. The thickening fog warns of the dangers that await when the light disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the woods are cryptic clues and unsettling reports. They tell the story of a missing girl, a grieving mother, and a sinister force at work. As you explore, the forest reveals strange occurrences and hidden messages that hint at a greater mystery. Unravel who you are, where you are, and how to escape this nightmarish place. Somewhere in the shadows lies a way out—but will you piece it together in time, or will the night claim you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of Her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not alone. Mara Vandernacht, a tormented figure shrouded in mystery, stalks the forest. She grows stronger and more relentless as the fire dims. Follow the blood-scrawled warnings: &quot;Don't look into her eyes,&quot; and find the key to your survival before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a tense atmosphere, strategic gameplay, and a compelling story, Ardena delivers a chilling experience that will stay with you long after the night is over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Horror Gameplay: Keep the campfire alive to survive the night and avoid Mara’s wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Exploration: Navigate a haunting forest, uncover its chilling secrets by collecting clues, gathering together cryptic messages to discover the truth and find a way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Tension: Experience an evolving atmosphere with thickening fog, ominous original soundtrack, and a relentless threat, crafted by fans of horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise Experience: Dive into an intense and immersive journey designed to be completed in under an hour, perfect for players seeking a focused and thrilling adventure.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the haunting world of Ardena, a first-person survival horror game that will test your wits and courage. Alone in a shadowy forest surrounded by an eerie silence, your only solace is a flickering campfire. But the fire won’t last forever—it’s up to you to keep it alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood to fuel your campfire, your only shield against the encroaching darkness. The fire's glow keeps you safe, but as it fades, the forest becomes more menacing. The thickening fog warns of the dangers that await when the light disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Truth and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the woods are cryptic clues and unsettling reports. They tell the story of a missing girl, a grieving mother, and a sinister force at work. As you explore, the forest reveals strange occurrences and hidden messages that hint at a greater mystery. Unravel who you are, where you are, and how to escape this nightmarish place. Somewhere in the shadows lies a way out—but will you piece it together in time, or will the night claim you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware of Her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not alone. Mara Vandernacht, a tormented figure shrouded in mystery, stalks the forest. She grows stronger and more relentless as the fire dims. Follow the blood-scrawled warnings: &quot;Don't look into her eyes,&quot; and find the key to your survival before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a tense atmosphere, strategic gameplay, and a compelling story, Ardena delivers a chilling experience that will stay with you long after the night is over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Horror Gameplay: Keep the campfire alive to survive the night and avoid Mara’s wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Exploration: Navigate a haunting forest, uncover its chilling secrets by collecting clues, gathering together cryptic messages to discover the truth and find a way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Tension: Experience an evolving atmosphere with thickening fog, ominous original soundtrack, and a relentless threat, crafted by fans of horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concise Experience: Dive into an intense and immersive journey designed to be completed in under an hour, perfect for players seeking a focused and thrilling adventure.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Ardena is a first-person survival horror game where your only light is a dwindling campfire. Gather wood to keep it burning, uncover chilling clues about you and your location, and find a way to escape the mysterious forest—before she finds you.",
